jobs.description:
Hey go-getter! Are you looking for a fun, dynamic job in logistics? Do you love it when your workday just flies by, and are you ready to dive into the world of books? Awesome! For CB in Culemborg, we are looking for logistics employees to join their fantastic returns department. You’ll earn an hourly wage starting at €15.49 (19+). Sounds good? Keep on reading!

What we offer
- A starting salary of €15.49 per hour (19+)
- Work together with enthusiastic colleagues
- Attractive allowances for evening shifts
- A 40-hour workweek
- Travel allowance. Always a nice bonus!
- An employer rated with an 8+ for work atmosphere

Who you are
As a logistics employee at CB, you are a team player who just can't sit still. Furthermore, you love staying active and you meet the following requirements:

- You are available to work full-time (40 hours);
- You are available from Monday to Friday and/or Sunday (you don't work on Saturdays);
- You are available in 2 shifts: 07:00-15:30 and 14:00-22:30;
- You speak Dutch or English;
- You are fully available in August and September at the very least, as summer is a very busy period at CB.

What will you do
As a logistics employee at CB, you will be working across various logistics and production processes. No two days are the same! You will be working in the OFM department. This is the ultimate place where, among other things, all returning books arrive. Your tasks will include:

- Packing books and customer orders and getting them completely ready for shipment;
- Picking the right orders—you know exactly where to find everything;
- Processing returns and neatly placing items back into stock;
- Taking care of internal restocking and transport flows.

Where will you work
As a logistics employee returns, you will find yourself in the warehouse of CB. CB is the largest book distribution center in the Netherlands! The company scores an 8+ for work atmosphere. So, it’s super fun! At CB, they organize great staff outings, there’s a lovely compa

At a precast concrete element factory in the Netherlands

Work tasks: The main responsibility is the production and assembly of wooden frames at the Constar Prefab B.V. factory.

The work includes, among other things:

* Manufacturing wooden structures and frames;
* Working according to technical drawings;
* Measuring, cutting and assembling components;
* Ensuring a high-quality and accurate result;
* Proper use and handling of tools and materials;
* Working as part of a team in the factory's daily production process.

The position requires good manual skills, accuracy and the ability to work independently according to provided drawings and instructions.

We offer: €18 net per hour – the employee receives €18 net for every hour worked.

In addition:

* Free accommodation – accommodation is provided in a large and comfortable private house.
* The usual value of the accommodation is more than €950 per month, but it is provided free of charge to the employee.
* Free transportation to and from work – a minibus is provided for commuting.
* Full-time employment – normally approximately 45–50 hours per week.
* Possibility of overtime – including, in some cases, Saturdays, providing an opportunity to increase your income.
* Permanent employment contract – Aalto Eesti OÜ concludes the employment contract with the employee, who will work as a temporary agency worker at Constar Prefab B.V.

Other requirements: We are looking for a candidate who has:

* At least 2 years of experience as a carpenter or in a similar position;
* Good knowledge of woodworking and the construction of wooden structures;
* Ability to read technical drawings;
* Good manual skills and technical understanding;
* A responsible and precise approach to work;
* Willingness to work full-time in the Netherlands;
* A strong work ethic and a reliable attitude as a team member.

English language skills: at least B1 level spoken and A2 level written.

Russian language skills are preferred.

Applicants must be Estonian citizens or holders of a valid European Union passport.

Option to work from home: No
